 "modules": [
  {
   "id": 1,
   "plugin": "Core",
   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "EMOTION\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 5, CC 33 to 48\n   1 Strength of the feeling\n   2 How they move\n   3 Feeling in the voice\n   4 Amount of movement\n   5 Amount said\n   6 Posture changes\n   7 Size of the actions\n   8 Mood of the place\n   9 Mood of the light\n  10 Against the last scene\n  11 Feeling gap between characters\n  12 suite: Feels loving\n  13 suite: Feels joyful\n  14 suite: Feels curious\n  15 suite: Feels melancholy\n  16 suite: Feels anxious\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 5, CC 49 to 64\n   1 suite: Feels fearful\n   2 suite: Feels angry\n   3 suite: Feels triumphant\n   4 suite: Feels absurd\n   5 suite: Feels dreamlike\n   6 suite: Emotion lens\n   7 suite: Feeling of the scene\n   8 suite: Held-back tears\n   9 suite: Rage boils over\n  10 suite: Quiet joy\n  11 suite: Frozen fear\n  12 suite: Mood whiplash\n  13 suite: Calm in the storm\n  14 suite: The mask slips\n  15 pair: When the mood of the light drops, the strength of the feeling rises\n  16 pair: When the feeling grows stronger, the posture changes more often\nCV-CC 3: MIDI channel 5, CC 65 to 72\n   1 pair: When a scene feels the opposite of the last one, the color shifts too\n   2 pair: When a feeling rises, the face shows it before the words\n   3 pair: When anger rises, the voice gets louder\n   4 pair: When fear rises, movement stops\n   5 pair: When one character's feeling overflows, others catch it\n   6 pair: When joy rises, the light warms\n   7 pairs: The body tells first\n   8 pairs: Feelings spread"
   },
